29tbWVudDUxMTQzOTI0OA==","user":{"login":"AlexisChup","id":47422165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NDIyMTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47422165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexisChup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexisChup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-07-15T15:01:37Z","updated_at":"2019-07-15T15:01:37Z","body":"# Workaround\r\n\r\nI finally find a workaroud :\r\n\r\nWhen I typed http://\"My_IPv4_address\":8000/\"My_Api\" on my computer, he said : **\"ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED\"**\r\n\r\nSo I tried to run $ **php bin/console server:run \"My_IPv4_address\":8000** \r\n\r\nA firewall notification appears to me, I accept it.\r\nI send my request again in my iOS device and I don't know why it works now.\r\n\r\nSo I need to run \r\n\r\n$ **php bin/console server:run**\r\n\r\nand in a other powershell\r\n\r\n$ **php bin/console server:run \"My_IPv4_address\":8000**\r\n\r\nto have access to my local API in my android emulator and my iOS device.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/511439248/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"comm